  READING: if TV(W')~spread^1 (only the few >1/7 gaps contribute) then TV/(12Vmax^2)~1/(12 spread)
  -> 0, and the TV bound gives R_abs<main a-priori for large spread. If TV~spread^2, the crude TV
  bound is useless (~const) and R_abs<main is genuine CANCELLATION (kps-S98 Mertens wall).
